        <mxCell id="-FWSHOEyrXsWot2iip2_-32" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Midler v. Ford Motor Company&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="240" x="11860" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-FWSHOEyrXsWot2iip2_-33" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Facts&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Bette Midler, a famous singer said no to a comererital and then ford went looking for one of her old back up singers and said they wanted someone who sounded like Midler.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="250" x="12060" y="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-FWSHOEyrXsWot2iip2_-34" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rules&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- &quot; The human voice is one of the most palpable ways identity is manifested.&quot;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;You can own your own likeness, but typically this only applies to a distinctive voice of a professional singer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="240" x="11790" y="355" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-FWSHOEyrXsWot2iip2_-35" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Issue&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Can you own your own identity/ voice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) unfair competition - no because would not saturated or curtailed her market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="170" x="11670" y="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NJRoxmUYRKO-0N-osmE_-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Reasoning for lack of ownership&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- scientific developments - if everyone owned their own cells then there would be no evolution or economic incentive for advancement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Pursuant to Health and Safety Code&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;213 214 VALUES SUBJECT TO OWNERSHIP CHAPTER III section 7054.4 &lt;/i&gt;- the cells must be thrown away in a special manner and thus he did not have ownership because he is not allowed to keep them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Some distinction between the cell line and his actual cells&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="360" x="11250" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NJRoxmUYRKO-0N-osmE_-4" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Dissent:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- he eats here&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;his cells should be treated as property&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;susceptible to conversion is not, in my view, ours to decide. &quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- even if he did say he was throwing it away in the health section code, does not mean all rights are given away&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- he had the rights to do what ever the defendant did with it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="240" x="10790" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
