        <mxCell id="wGQi0n4J2-Beg7k2Higl-4" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ploof v. Putnam&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- dock and boat necessity defense&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- exemption to right to exclude&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="240" x="12620" y="47.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wGQi0n4J2-Beg7k2Higl-5" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Facts&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- the Ploof&#39;s were sailing when a sudden storm hit and tied off to the defendants dock.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-Then the defendant, via his servant, untied the Ploof&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="250" x="12820" y="217.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wGQi0n4J2-Beg7k2Higl-6" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rules&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- circumstances are taken into account for the right to exclude from one&#39;s property&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Thus bending the stick of right to exclude, or maybe shortenenting it a little.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- necessity elements (1) emergency out of control (2) time pressure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="240" x="12550" y="367.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wGQi0n4J2-Beg7k2Higl-7" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Issue&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Creation of the necessity defense&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) did the servant trespass by unmooring the boat&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) duty of defendant to permit the plaintiff to moor his boat in an emergency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="210" x="12390" y="207.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
