        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-14" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#3399FF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Principle of Accession&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;O&lt;i&gt;wnership of one thing is assigned to owner of another&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;“thing”&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Crops and vegetation -&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Perennial vs. Annual vegetation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Ad coelum (caves) - you own every cave, even if not accessible&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Combinations - good faith transformation of objects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Fixtures - permanency of the annexation or inferable use of real property &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Accretion -&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Avulsion - not tech nicely accession&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="410" x="3840" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-18" edge="1" parent="1" source="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#00FF00);" target="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-17" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-15" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Crops and Vegetation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perennial vegetation (&lt;i&gt;fructus naturales&lt;/i&gt;) → rejuvenates from year to year without replanting → deemed to belong to the &lt;u&gt;owner&lt;/u&gt; of the soil on which it grows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Annual vegetation (fructus industriales) → must be replanted on an annual or other periodic basis → deemed to belong to the party in &lt;u&gt;possession&lt;/u&gt; of the soil on which it grows&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="370" x="3610" y="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-17" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Extra Doctrines&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Doctrine of emblements:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;protects tenant farmers when lease is “tenancy at will”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Doctrine of increase&lt;/b&gt;: Offspring of domestic animal belongs to owner of the mother&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="330" x="3400" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-19" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ad coelum (Caves)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Edwards v. Sims&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ad coelum applies to caves, regardless of the location of the entrance(s)&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="280" x="3860" y="543.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-21" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Principle of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Combinations:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;if D takes P’s &lt;u&gt;tangible personal property&lt;/u&gt; and makes something new, D may be permitted to keep the new item and compensate P for the pre-improvement value of the property D took&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) &lt;b&gt;Good faith&lt;/b&gt; (that is, D must show s/he made an honest mistake in taking P’s property&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2)&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Fundamental transformation&lt;/b&gt;, which is satisfied by EITHER&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(a) Change of species/chemical transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(b) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;A significant increase in value&amp;nbsp;(Weatehrbee)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ some physical transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="350" x="4040" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9bMlIWe9H1ZLCatLLdI-23" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#E6D0DE);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Fixtures&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Firstmerit Bank, N.A. v. Antioch Bowling Lanes&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;The court determines that in a case like this it must look “less to the permanency of annexation (i.e., whether the property in question can be moved) and more to the issue of whether the property in question is appropriated or adapted to the use or purpose of the part of the realty to which it is annexed.”&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Although typically we look to the&lt;b&gt; permanency of the attachment&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;we can also look to see if the &#39;personal property or temporary fixtures&#39; were inferable to the use of the real property.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="410" x="4330" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
