        <mxCell id="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-17" edge="1" parent="1" source="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-16" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cM22u7yP_w4kU0iDP5lB-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="cM22u7yP_w4kU0iDP5lB-1" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-7" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Elements&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;OCEANS:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) &lt;b&gt;Open &amp;amp; notorious&lt;/b&gt;: must “fly his/her flag over the property” in such a way as to put the actual owner on notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) &lt;b&gt;Continuous&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;i&gt;note&lt;/i&gt;: continuous use of that property in the reasonable manor (swamp / vacation home )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) &lt;b&gt;Exclusive&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Actual physical exclusion &lt;b&gt;or&lt;/b&gt; control access to the property as a true owner would: granting hunting licenses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(4) &lt;b&gt;Actua&lt;/b&gt;l:&amp;nbsp;Actual possession&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(5) &lt;b&gt;Non-permissiv&lt;/b&gt;e: without permission&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(6) &lt;b&gt;Statutory period&lt;/b&gt;: &amp;nbsp;CA is 5 years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="298.12" width="380" x="5430" y="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-11" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Bad Faith&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;California rule&lt;/b&gt;: only look to non-permissiveness&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Iowa rule:&lt;/b&gt; Knowledge the land is not yours is bad faith and no AP&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="138.12" width="300" x="5980" y="543.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-14" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tacking (combining time for continuous &amp;amp; statutory period)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;Howard v. Kunto&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Tacking” periods of possession for AP purposes → permitted where adverse possessors are in privity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Privity - &amp;nbsp;if there is a written conveyance from one party to another, there is privity&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="159.06" width="360" x="5940" y="310.94000000000005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uTMMKyZyg1DaEdCWIRSF-16" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Personal Property&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Songbyrd&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Statutory period is generally shorter for personal property than for real property&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- statute of limitations for adverse possession of personal property starts to run at the moment of conversion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Except&lt;/i&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(1)  good faith purchaser &amp;amp; good price&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(2)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;statute of limitations does not start to run until the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; TO makes demand for return and the person in possession refuses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;to return it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="390" x="5640" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
