        <mxCell id="69Vev4vKfaQLIudUFsxh-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#66B2FF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Estates&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;Fee Simple absolute&lt;/b&gt; -&amp;nbsp;The fee simple absolute is the largest package of ownership rights, from which others are&amp;nbsp;carved &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;Life estate &lt;/b&gt;- &lt;/span&gt;comes to a natural end with the death of a named person&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Defensible Fees&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;a. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;Fee simple determinativ&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;e &lt;/b&gt;- ends automatically upon the occurrence of a named event,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;b. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;Fee simple subject to condition&lt;/i&gt; - Continues indefinitely until occurrence, but does not end automatically, may be ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;Fee simple subject to executory&lt;/b&gt; - defeasible fee is followed by an interest not reserved to the grantor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
