        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-15" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Defeasible Fees / Restraints on Alienation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Mountain Brow Lodge v. Toscano&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;[1] &amp;nbsp; Use restriction (&quot;for use and benefit of Mountain Brow Lodge only&quot;):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;→ VALID&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;[2] Direct restraint on alienation (&quot;in the event of sale or transfer, it reverts&quot;):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;→ VOID&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="390" x="8580" y="2770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-19" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Restraints on Alienation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Morse v. Blood&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;[1] &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A condition that effectively &lt;b&gt;operates as a complete restraint on alienation is void&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="290" x="8200" y="2790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-26" edge="1" parent="1" source="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-22" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-25" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-28" edge="1" parent="1" source="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-22" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-27" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-33" edge="1" parent="1" source="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-22" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-31">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-22" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rule Against Perpetuities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(1)&amp;nbsp;No interest is &lt;b&gt;valid&lt;/b&gt; unless it must&lt;b&gt; vest or terminate&lt;/b&gt; within &lt;b&gt;21 years after the death&lt;/b&gt; of some life in being at the creation of the grant.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2)&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Validity&lt;/b&gt; is determined at the moment of creation — based on what could happen, not what actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Subject to RAP&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Contingent remainders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Vested remainders subject to open&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Executory interests&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;NOT subject to RAP &lt;/i&gt;(deemed vested from creation):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Possibility of reverter&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Right of entry / power of termination&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Vested remainders (indefeasibly vested or subject to complete defeasance)&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="320" width="400" x="8430" y="2040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-25" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;RAP Rules&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Symphony Space v. Pergola Properties&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(1) Organizations cannot serve as measuring lives&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(2)&amp;nbsp;Options to purchase are subject to RAP&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3)&amp;nbsp;&quot;Wait and see&quot; is rejected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;The option could have been exercised in 2003&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;25 years after creation → could vest outside&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;perpetuities period → void from the moment it was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; created.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="300" x="8810" y="1680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-27" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;RAP&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Exeptions&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(1)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Right of first refusal — holder cannot force a sale; only gets first dibs if the owner chooses to sell.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2)&amp;nbsp;Option appurtenant to a lease — option is embedded in and terminates with the lease itself. Doesn&#39;t discourage improvement because if the tenant exercises it, they&#39;re going to own and improve the property anyway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3)&amp;nbsp;3. Charity-to-charity exception — if BOTH the present interest and the future interest are held by charitable institutions → executory interest is exempt from RAP.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="310" x="8400" y="1580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Cu2xMsc4gobcbpk_UVLG-31" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;RAP Remedy&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;City of Klamath Falls v. Bell&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-decoration-line: underline;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;The &lt;b&gt;RAP Remedy&lt;/b&gt; — the critical sequence:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 1: Strike the void interest&lt;/b&gt; (Daggett and Schallock&#39;s executory interest)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 2: Look at what remains&lt;/b&gt; — &quot;to the City so long as used for a library&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step 3: That language creates&lt;/b&gt; a fee simple determinable + implied possibility of reverter in the grantor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="450" x="7900" y="1660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
