        <mxCell id="JGdcAE9lbHhbZdBGjv53-6" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#3399FF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Concurrent Ownership&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;[1] &amp;nbsp;Partition&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(2)&amp;nbsp;Severance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(3) Cotenant Rights/Duties: Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="8300" y="285" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JGdcAE9lbHhbZdBGjv53-7" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partition&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Delfino v. Vealencis&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-decoration-line: underline;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Core Rule: When co-tenants disagree, there is a (1) &lt;b&gt;strong presumption in favor of partition in kind&lt;/b&gt; over partition by sale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Partition by sale only when:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;[1] Physical attributes of the property&amp;nbsp;impracticable or inequitable&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;[2]&amp;nbsp;interests of the owners would be better promoted by a sale&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="330" x="8320" y="-10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JGdcAE9lbHhbZdBGjv53-8" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ouster&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Gillmor v. Gillmor&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Ouster requires:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Co-tenant out of possession makes an &lt;b&gt;unequivocal demand to use the land&lt;/b&gt;, AND&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) Co-tenant in possession &lt;b&gt;refuses to accommodate that right&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;*Sole use of the entire property, in and of itself, does NOT constitute ouster&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="330" x="8590" y="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JGdcAE9lbHhbZdBGjv53-9" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Severance / Mortgage Exemption&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Harms v. Sprague&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) A mortgage on one joint tenant&#39;s interest does NOT sever the joint tenancy. Court adopts lien theory over title theory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="300" x="8260" y="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
